  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to finance for horticulture farmers (PCB23UG01)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Using the findings of the PADEO report, this project aims to explore and design the necessary interventions, needed to improve the value proposition of smallholder farmers (SHF), in particular women and youth, towards existing financial services providers (FSPs), building on the existing HORTIMAP project, funded by the Netherlands embassy in Kampala, Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
